[0.012, "o", "\r\r\n\u001b[38;2;120;129;145m\u001b[2m==================================================\u001b[0m\r\r\n  Interactive mode. Type 'exit' to quit.\r\r\n\u001b[38;2;120;129;145m\u001b[2m==================================================\r\r\n\u001b[0m\r\r\n>>> What is the latest stable Python release? Use official sources and cite them.\r\r\n\r\r\n\u001b[38;2;120;129;145m\u001b[2m──────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\r\n"]
