[23.769, "o", "  \u001b[38;2;145;132;174m\u001b[1m[REQUIREMENTS]\u001b[0m 3 criteria, answer_mode=strict\r\r\n    1. Identify the latest stable Python release version.\r\r\n    2. Use official sources to determine the version.\r\r\n    3. Provide citations for the information used.\r\r\n"]
[0.001, "o", "\r\r\n  \u001b[38;2;112;143;181m\u001b[1m[PLAN]\u001b[0m Breaking down: What is the latest stable Python release? Use official sources and cite them.\r\r\n"]
