[0.006, "o", "\r\r\n  \u001b[38;2;178;153;102m\u001b[1m[LEDGER]\u001b[0m Reviewing proof from 1 candidate sources (answer_mode=strict)...\r\r\n"]
[54.272, "o", "  \u001b[38;2;178;153;102m\u001b[1m[LEDGER]\u001b[0m supported claims 2; supported sources 1/1; answer_ready=False\r\r\n    gaps: Verification that 3.14.6 is the 'stable' release and not a pre-release or bugfix-only release, as the source lists both 'Active Python releases' (with 3.14 listed as bugfix) and specific version numbers., Confirmation that the highest version number listed (3.14.6) is officially categorized as the 'latest stable' release rather than just a bugfix release.\r\r\n    next: web_read: https://www.python.org/downloads/\r\r\n"]
