[0.228, "o", "\r\r\nThe latest stable Python release is version 3.14.6, which was released on June 10, 2026 [1].\r\r\n\r\r\n\u001b[38;2;112;143;181m\u001b[1mSources:\u001b[0m\r\r\n  [1] Download Python | Python.org — https://www.python.org/downloads/\r\r\n\u001b[38;2;112;143;181m\u001b[1mPDF report:\u001b[0m reports/2026-08-03_what-is-the-latest-stable-python-release-use-official-source_res_4df4ffdb9052.pdf\r\r\n"]
